Test: srand() function
--------------------------------------
  srand(42) returned: 42
  First rand() after seed(42): 0.639427

  After srand(42) again, rand(): 0.639427
  (Should match first rand() if seeding works correctly)

  After srand(100), rand(): 0.145669
  (Should be different from previous values)

  srand() (no arg) returns the current timestamp
